sanitation-waste-planner

Third-party material in this repository

  Libraries bundled into assets/ by the build (see package.json for versions)
    React (MIT), MapLibre GL JS (BSD 3-Clause), Recharts (MIT), pdf.js / pdfjs-dist (Apache 2.0),
    Anek Bangla typeface via @fontsource-variable/anek-bangla (SIL Open Font License 1.1).

  Town positions (data/places.json)
    Sub-district centres derived from bangladesh-geojson (github.com/ifahimreza/bangladesh-geojson),
    which is built from OpenStreetMap data, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, Open Database Licence (ODbL).
    Eight town positions from GeoNames (CC BY 4.0).

  Map tiles and place search, loaded at run time and not redistributed here
    (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL. Tiles from tile.openstreetmap.org; place search by Nominatim.

  Test fixture text (tests/fixtures/)
    Pages of the SFD Lite Report for Kaliakair Municipality, CWIS-FSM Support Cell, DPHE, 2023 (SFD portal),
    and labels and figures from the WFD Data Portal case-study page for Kaliakair. See tests/fixtures/README.md.

Methods and source material referred to, not redistributed here

  Shit Flow Diagram (SFD) method and system codes: SFD Promotion Initiative / SuSanA.
  The 50 SFDs summarised in data/sfd.json are SFD Lite, level 0.5, status Draft,
  prepared by the CWIS-FSM Support Cell, DPHE.

  Waste Flow Diagram (WFD): GIZ, University of Leeds, Eawag, Wasteaware. The WFD figures in
  data/wfd.json are the outputs of the study's own tool files. WFD Data Portal reports are
  copyright GIZ and are not included in this repository.
